<title>USA: TABLE - HOME CENTERS LTD Q2 NET RISES.</title>
<headline>TABLE - HOME CENTERS LTD Q2 NET RISES.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			   0.58		     0.27</p>
<p> Net			  2,900		    1,400</p>
<p> Revs		     112,300		   60,000</p>
<p>			6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			   0.62		     0.55</p>
<p> Net			  3,100		    2,700</p>
<p> Revs		     198,300		  125,600</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures above are in new Israeli shekels.</p>
<p>Translated In U.S. dollars, 1997 Q2 net income is $800,000 or $0.16 per share on $31.3 million in revenues.</p>
<p>1997 year-to-date net income is $900,000 or $0.17 per share on $55.3 million in revenues when translated into U.S. Dollars.  Translation into dollars made at exchange rate of US$1 to NIS 3.587.</p>
<p>Home Centers Ltd is headquartered in Bnei-Brak, Israel.</p>
